[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:00.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:04.82]left a single note and went on their way
[00:09.81]I never got their name until the credits
[00:15.69]now it plays here every single day
[00:19.75]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:24.12]One note at a time
[00:28.48]from people passing through
[00:33.64]a name beside a line
[00:38.66]and part of it is you
[00:44.06]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
